# A NuPatch issued inside FrameBegin/FrameEnd before any WorldBegin --
# the "F"-only block state cmdNuPatch's W|A|T|S|O|M mask excludes
# (gmangraphicstate.cpp). uknot/vknot are well-formed (the declared
# nu+uorder/nv+vorder lengths) so parseNuPatch's own knot-length check
# does not intercept this first; allowed(cmdNuPatch) throws before this
# task's own validation ever runs, after parseNuPatch's knot arrays are
# already owned and before its trailing delete[]s -- the one fixture
# proving that ownership.
#
# Unlike every other malformed/nupatch_*.rib fixture, this one is not
# followed by a Sphere: the throw unwinds out of GMANRIBParse::parse()
# before any trailing request would parse, and gman itself exits 1.
FrameBegin 1
NuPatch 2 2 [0 0 1 1] 0 1 2 2 [0 0 1 1] 0 1
	"P" [-1 -1 0  1 -1 0  -1 1 0  1 1 0]
FrameEnd
